  "note": "Authored rules for the 'authored-rules' strategy (spec D18). The score is the HIGHEST rule that fires. A rule fires when impact >= minImpact AND immediacy >= minImmediacy AND every key in 'requires' is true (people, distress, ongoing). Because rules can only add, raising impact or immediacy can never lower a score. People and distress are already folded into impact/immediacy by the feature extractor, so no rule here re-counts them.",
